    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The agency is aware of the loss of real-time alerts; we've already scheduled manual monitoring protocols to cover those gaps for the time being. \n\nHowever, you mentioned that recreating the predictive models offline would be a different process from maintaining the live instance. In your assessment, what is the specific risk profile of moving from active, real-time predictive modeling to a manual/offline response structure?",
